---
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/iceland_portrait.webp";
---

<section class="px-5 md:px-12 pt-16 md:pt-28">
  <SectionHeader id="about" index="04" title="ABOUT" meta="VENICE, CA" />

  <div class="md:flex md:items-start md:gap-14">
    <div class="md:w-[380px] lg:w-[420px] md:shrink-0">
      <div class="overflow-hidden border border-encore-line">
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="Adrian Cacho in Iceland"
          class="w-full h-[380px] md:h-[560px] object-cover"
          widths={[390, 840]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 420px, 100vw"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <p class="font-smono text-encore-dim text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-[2px] m-0 pt-2 md:pt-3">
        ICELAND
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 md:pt-0 md:flex-1 max-w-[820px]">
      <p class="font-grotesk font-medium text-encore-fg text-lg md:text-2xl leading-[1.5] m-0">
        I run light for rooms of thousands and build software for platforms of
        millions. For eight years I've moved between the booth and the codebase
        — VJing stages like <a
          href="/#shows"
          class="text-encore-accent no-underline hover:text-encore-fg transition-colors"
          >Proper NYE</a
        > while shipping the platforms behind immersive tech: <a
          href="https://blocks.glass"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-encore-accent no-underline hover:text-encore-fg transition-colors"
          >blocks.glass</a
        >, the first hologram CMS, serving 100,000+ assets; and the 3D pipeline
        Snap acquired with Vertebrae.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-0 h-px bg-encore-line my-6 md:my-8" />

      <p class="font-inter text-encore-dim text-base md:text-[17px] leading-[1.7] m-0">
        Lately that frontier is agentic AI — MCP servers, agent tools, and the
        evals that measure them as First Resonance's first AI engineer, and
        TwelveLabs' agentic video editor. The thread through all of it: systems
        that turn creative intent into something running live, whether the
        runtime is a render pipeline or a stage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
